# Layering

Stack folders: `backend` / `frontend` / `packages`. **This file wins on "where does this concern belong?"**

## Package graph

```text
apps/web ──► packages/shared     # Zod/types; no @elynd/db
apps/api ──► packages/shared
apps/api ──► packages/db         # tables + drizzle-zod
apps/api ──► packages/email      # sendMail for non-auth mail (optional)
@elynd/auth ──► packages/db
@elynd/auth ──► packages/email   # sendResetPassword → sendMail
@elynd/shared                    # NO @elynd/db
@elynd/db                        # NO @elynd/shared (unless concrete need)
@elynd/email                     # NO Nest / apps / db / auth
```

| Forbidden |
| --- |
| `apps/web` ↔ `apps/api` imports; **`shared → db`**; **`web → email`** |
| Business workflows inside `@elynd/db` / `@elynd/shared` |
| Tables/columns outside `packages/db` |
| One file mixing HTTP-server and UI-render |

`db` and `shared` are siblings; apps compose them. drizzle-zod HTTP DTOs in `apps/api` (or inside `@elynd/db`). Root tooling (`tsconfig.base.json`, prettier, eslint) is not a package; Nest/Next TS options stay per app.

## Concern → layer

| Concern | Lives in | Must not |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Domain workflow | `apps/api` features, `apps/web/features/**` | Generic `lib/`, shared config pkgs |
| Tech capability (no domain) | `lib/` / `common/` | Import features |
| Transport cross-cutting | API `common/` / web guards | Domain workflows |
| Cross-app Zod/DTO (2+ apps) | `@elynd/shared` | Dup schemas; ORM imports |
| API-only drizzle-zod DTOs | `apps/api` feature | `@elynd/shared` |
| Persistence schema | `@elynd/db` only | Ad-hoc tables in apps |
| Server/remote state | Query/data layer | Zustand as API SoT |
| Client UI state | UI store | Secrets; server lists as SoT |
| Design-system atoms | `components/ui/**` | Feature rules |

In-app: `routes/pages/controllers → feature services → tech lib → I/O`. No upward imports. No extra tiers (repository/use-case/facade) without concrete pain.

## Cross-layer propagation (HARD)

Downstream only; typecheck each layer before the next:

`packages/db` + `packages/shared` → `apps/api` → `apps/web`

| Trigger | Order |
| --- | --- |
| DB schema | schema → API DTOs (drizzle-zod) → tests → web |
| Shared validator/type | shared → API + web |
| API response shape | API (+tests) → shared if public → web → UI |
| Shared constant | define once in owner / `@elynd/shared`; import |

Never update only one layer. Same-fact copies: see SSOT in `core`.

## Constants

Literal in **2+** modules → named constant in owning package (or `@elynd/shared` if cross-app). One-off → local. Prefer `as const` over `enum`.
